                <sc:Class>
                  <sc:name>DistanceCondition</sc:name>
                  <sc:id>206</sc:id>
                  <sc:descriptors>
                    <sc:definition>
                      <sc:descriptorValues>
                        <sc:DescriptorValue>The current distance between an entity and a position is compared to a given distance (less, greater, equal). Several additional parameters like free space etc. can be defined. The property "alongRoute" is deprecated. If "coordinateSystem" or "relativeDistanceType" are set, "alongRoute" is ignored.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:definition>
                    <sc:documentation>
                      <sc:descriptorValues>
                        <sc:DescriptorValue>The current distance between an entity and a position is compared to a given distance (less, greater, equal). Several additional parameters like free space etc. can be defined. The property "alongRoute" is deprecated. If "coordinateSystem" or "relativeDistanceType" are set, "alongRoute" is ignored.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:documentation>
                  </sc:descriptors>
                  <sc:properties>
                    <sc:Property>
                      <sc:name>alongRoute</sc:name>
                      <sc:id>206_321</sc:id>
