                        <sc:DescriptorValue>Value constraints represent a single rule to a given parameter in a parameter declaration. Note that value must match the type of the enclosing parameter declaration. A ValueConstraint for  parameter declaration of type "string" must use either "equalTo" or "notEqualTo" for the rule property.</sc:DescriptorValue>
