                        <sc:DescriptorValue>Represents the weight of a given vehicle role within a traffic definition. The relative probability for the occurrence of this role is defined by the weight divided by the sum of all weights of this distribution.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:definition>
