                            <sc:DescriptorValue>The time to reach the specified speed. First entry specifies delta from start of the action, remaining entries delta from previous entry. If omitted, the speed will be reached as soon as possible given the performance settings. Unit: [s]. Range: [0..inf[.</sc:DescriptorValue>
