                <sc:Class>
                  <sc:name>RelativeAngleCondition</sc:name>
                  <sc:id>351</sc:id>
                  <sc:descriptors>
                    <sc:definition>
                      <sc:descriptorValues>
                        <sc:DescriptorValue>Checks if the relative angle of the triggering entity, measured with respect to the reference entity, has reached a given value, within some user-specified angle tolerance.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The relative angle is generally measured as angle of the triggering entity minus angle of the reference entity.&#xD;&#xA;Both angles must be measured in the same coordinate system, as specified by the user.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;When the entity value is used, the angles are measured in the local coordinate system of the reference entity.&#xD;&#xA;Note that for the s-t coordinate systems the orientation is measured at the local s-coordinate of each entity.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:definition>
                    <sc:documentation>
                      <sc:descriptorValues>
                        <sc:DescriptorValue>Checks if the relative angle of the triggering entity, measured with respect to the reference entity, has reached a given value, within some user-specified angle tolerance.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The relative angle is generally measured as angle of the triggering entity minus angle of the reference entity.&#xD;&#xA;Both angles must be measured in the same coordinate system, as specified by the user.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;When the entity value is used, the angles are measured in the local coordinate system of the reference entity.&#xD;&#xA;Note that for the s-t coordinate systems the orientation is measured at the local s-coordinate of each entity.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:documentation>
                  </sc:descriptors>
                  <sc:properties>
                    <sc:Property>
                      <sc:name>angleType</sc:name>
