                        <sc:DescriptorValue>Defines whether time information present in trajectories should be considered. If considered, it may be used as either absolute or relative time values. Moreover, a time offset or time scaling may be applied.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:definition>
