                            <sc:DescriptorValue>A wheelchair is a manually or electrically powered mobility device with a seat mounted on a wheeled frame. Manual propulsion may be provided by the seated person or a person pushing the wheelchair.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                          </sc:descriptorValues>
                        </sc:definition>
                        <sc:documentation>
